/* read銆乽mask銆俽ead 浠庢弿杩扮 0 閫愪釜鍏綅缁勮涓€琛岋紝鎸?IFS 鍒囩粰鍙橀噺锛?r 涓嶅悆鍙嶆枩鏉狅紝-p 鎶婃彁绀哄啓鍒版爣鍑嗛敊璇€?   umask 鏄３鐘舵€侊紙bstate 閲岀殑 umask 瀛楋級锛氭煡璇㈠拰鍏繘鍒惰缃畬鏁达紝鍐呮牳鍒涘缓娌℃湁 umask 闈€?   ulimit 鍦?run 鐨勫垎鍙戣〃閲屾槑纭姤涓嶆敮鎸侊紙鍐呮牳娌℃湁璧勬簮闄愬埗闈紝涓嶈鍋囩姸鎬侊級銆?*/
#DYN
#LINK /sh.obr, /draw.obr, /work.obr, /span.obr, /env.obr, /cd.obr, /run.obr, /complete.obr, /parse.obr, /builtin.obr, /expand.obr, /edit-check.obr, /bcore.obr, /bstate.obr, /bvar.obr, /bflow.obr, /bopt.obr, /bjob.obr, /bcmd.obr, /bio.obr, /builtin-check.obr
import memory;
import obr.proc;
import bcore;
import bstate;
import bvar;
import env;
import span;
import parse;
import draw;
import work;
import bio;


/* 鏀朵竴琛岀殑缂撳啿鍙湪杩欓噷鐢宠涓€娆★細鍘熷琛屻€佸幓鍙嶆枩鏉犺銆両FS銆佸瓧娈靛尯鍚?8192 鍏綅缁勩€?*/
deRfun biBuf(long home, long work): long {
  long slot = lineBufAt(work);
  long buf = memory::load64(slot);
  if (buf == 0L) {
    buf = obr::proc::alloc(home, 8192L * 4L * 8L);
    memory::store64(buf, slot);
  }
  return buf;
}


/* IFS 鍙栧€硷細娌¤缃槸榛樿绌虹櫧銆傝缃垚绌轰覆灏辨槸涓嶅垏鍒嗐€?*/
deRfun biIfs(long env, long work, long ifs): long {
  long value = 0L;
  long valueLen = 0L;
  if (envByName(env, work, "IFS", &value, &valueLen) == 0L) {
    bcPut(ifs, 0L, 32L);
    bcPut(ifs, 1L, 9L);
    bcPut(ifs, 2L, 10L);
    return 3L;
  }
  if (valueLen > 64L) {
    valueLen = 64L;
  }
  copySpan(value, ifs, valueLen);
  return valueLen;
}


deRfun biRead(long home, long bs, long state, long work, long out, long env, long envTmp, long body, long cmd, long command, long status, long* leaving): long {
  long keep = 0L;
  long at = command + 1L;
  while (at < cmdArgc(cmd)) {
    long word = cmdArgAt(cmd, at);
    long len = cmdArgLen(cmd, at);
    if (len < 2L || bcU8(word) != 45L || bcU8(word + 8L) == 45L) {
      break;
    }
    long index = 1L;
    while (index < len) {
      long letter = bcU8(word + index * 8L);
      if (letter == 114L) {
        keep = 1L;
      } else if (letter == 112L) {
        at = at + 1L;
        if (at >= cmdArgc(cmd)) {
          sayErr(home, "sh: read: -p requires a prompt\n");
          return 2L;
        }
        sayErrSpan(home, cmdArgAt(cmd, at), cmdArgLen(cmd, at));
      } else {
        sayErr(home, "sh: read: invalid option\n");
        return 2L;
      }
      index = index + 1L;
    }
    at = at + 1L;
  }
  long names = cmdArgc(cmd) - at;
  if (names < 1L) {
    sayErr(home, "sh: read: usage: read [-r] [-p prompt] name ...\n");
    return 2L;
  }
  if (biBuf(home, work) == 0L) {
    sayErr(home, "sh: read: out of memory\n");
    return 1L;
  }
  long buf = biBuf(home, work);
  long total = 0L;
  long eof = 0L;
  /* 内核的 read 是定位读（与 pwrite 对称）：位移要按实际个数往前推，
     文件重定向才不会每轮都重读第一个八位组、到不了 EOF。控制台和管道忽略位移，
     推进无害；bfDot 的脚本读取就是这个推法。 */
  long offset = 0L;
  while (1) {
    if (obr::proc::read(home, 0L, offset, 1L) != 0L) {
      eof = 1L;
      break;
    }
    long got = obr::proc::slot(home, 320L);
    if (got < 1L) {
      eof = 1L;
      break;
    }
    offset = offset + got;
    long unit = bcU8(obr::proc::bytes(home));
    if (unit == 10L) {
      break;
    }
    if (total < 8192L) {
      bcPut(buf, total, unit);
      total = total + 1L;
    }
  }
  long line = buf + 8192L * 8L;
  long lineLen = bcUnescape(line, buf, total, keep);
  long ifs = buf + 16384L * 8L;
  long ifsLen = biIfs(env, work, ifs);
  long pos = 0L;
  long index = 0L;
  long code = 0L;
  while (index < names) {
    long name = cmdArgAt(cmd, at + index);
    long nameLen = cmdArgLen(cmd, at + index);
    if (index + 1L < names) {
      long outAddr = buf + 24576L * 8L;
      long fieldLen = 0L;
      if (bcSplitField(line, lineLen, &pos, ifs, ifsLen, outAddr, 1024L, &fieldLen) == 0L) {
        fieldLen = 0L;
      }
      if (bvAssign(bs, env, name, nameLen, outAddr, fieldLen) != 0L) {
        sayErrMissing(home, "sh: read: ", name, nameLen, ": readonly variable\n");
        code = 1L;
      }
    } else {
      long rest = bcTrimTail(line + pos * 8L, lineLen - pos, ifs, ifsLen);
      if (bvAssign(bs, env, name, nameLen, line + pos * 8L, rest) != 0L) {
        sayErrMissing(home, "sh: read: ", name, nameLen, ": readonly variable\n");
        code = 1L;
      }
    }
    index = index + 1L;
  }
  if (eof == 1L && total == 0L) {
    return 1L;
  }
  return code;
}


deRfun biUmask(long home, long bs, long state, long work, long out, long env, long envTmp, long body, long cmd, long command, long status, long* leaving): long {
  if (cmdArgc(cmd) <= command + 1L) {
    long at = bcPutOct3(scratchAt(work), bsUmask(bs));
    saySpan(home, work, scratchAt(work), at);
    say(home, work, "\n");
    return 0L;
  }
  long word = cmdArgAt(cmd, command + 1L);
  long len = cmdArgLen(cmd, command + 1L);
  if (len == 2L && bcU8(word) == 45L) {
    sayErr(home, "sh: umask: symbolic form is not supported\n");
    return 1L;
  }
  long value = 0L;
  if (bcOct(word, len, &value) != 0L) {
    sayErr(home, "sh: umask: bad octal mask\n");
    return 1L;
  }
  bsUmaskSet(bs, value);
  return 0L;
}
